Differents output formats that nmap provides.
OUTPUT formats:

-oN //Normal format, save the results with the format that we've typically seen on the terminal.

-oX //XML format, we can save the nmap results to a XML formats and import them to the Metasploit Framework database,
and have all relevant information about the target. That make esier to have a centralise view of the target.

-oS //Script kiddie format

-oG //Grepable format, using grep.
